        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-CLAYSCAPE-USDA-LEED-THEOREMS-21-25-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-USDA-LEED-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH21-DAYLIGHT-HARVEST-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH22-CARNOT-COP-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH23-PSYCHROMETRIC-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH24-ECONOMIZER-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH25-NC30-ACOUSTIC-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-USDA-LEED-WITNESS        PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-USDA-LEED-THEOREMS.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-USDA-LEED-THEOREMS.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH21-DAYLIGHT-HARVEST-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH22-CARNOT-COP-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH23-PSYCHROMETRIC-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH24-ECONOMIZER-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH25-NC30-ACOUSTIC-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-USDA-LEED-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-USDA-LEED-WITNESS.
